{
  "id": "REV.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "REV",
  "reference": "Geehhoeema 1",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "REV 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaarí a gár Mungú aa geehhoeés dír Yesu Kristo, as Yesu Kristo muruudá' hardáh ar gaanslaay nguwa laqan dír sagadiyuuseerós. Kristo malaykamoowós guri ya/aáw amór sagadiyusmoowós Yohane, as muruuwí nguwa dirós i laqan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee Yohane muruudá' sleémeero aa ár guri alki/iít. Inós axweesantá Mungú gari lamabu'ún, nee lamabu'úngw Yesu Kristo sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé amohhoó' a kudá' axweesantá aaru'uumarí ga soomuús. Nee múk amohhoó' a kudá' tidá' taa baraakií gooín ga axamiís nee gaa oh. Asma qooma aa naká/.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anuú Yohane muruuwí una gooiím amór múk kríshaanáy oo baraá gixsadaá faanqw awa baraá yaamaá Asia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsuuqa nee wayda kudá' amór Mungú dahhá' masók i dinkwa nee kuungá'. Inós an kudá' dáw, nee kudá' qaroó daadáw, nee kudá' hardáh. Nee slám tsuuqaaká' nee wayda amór i dahhiya' a amór qeeremoodá' faanqw, kudá' dír geeraá kitaangós oo aleesleemuú i diriiá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee amór i dahhiya' sleeme a amór Yesu Kristo. Inós an lamabu'usmoó inkihhím, nee slám inós an heé geera oo naa waaslee/ baraá múk aa qatli. Nee a waawutmoó waawitá sleémeero baraá yaamuwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós atén tin slaa', nee tina gweér baraá lawaali'iimár tlakweemaá wa ale ar tseereerós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós atén tina waawuti'iimár i sláy, tiri kaahamuusér Mungú wa qaás, as atén Mungú, Baabuúwós, kuwa sagadiyuusaan. Xirif nee aleesleemu i dirós ay alhhe'eesay wasle. Amin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaytsiít, inós ni hardah ar baraá huunkáy. Umuúqo heewo guri ar ar ila', tam mukdá' inós gwa mutin sleeme guri ar. Nee muu sleémeero oo baraaká' yaamu iri /aa/amín ar gurhaami as inós. Eeít, adoorí an adoodá' tleehharuut. Amin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aakoó Mungú i kaahi, «Aníng an Alfa nee Omega, aníng an iimu/uungw nee alhhe'eesaay.» Aníng an kudá' qaroó dáw, kudá' daadáw, nee kudá' hardáh, kuduú Aleesleemusmoó mura' sleémeero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng a Yohane, hhiyaahúng, kudá' aa al dinku'uus nee kuungá' baraá slahh'amaayeero, nee baraá Waawuti'iima, nee baraá qiqtliingw baraá Yesuwo. Qoomarkaaro aníng ana hardáh baraá yaamaá kaahaar awa tla/ángw tlawi, awa ta bay Patmo, as a axweesantá Mungú ngiwa alki/iit nee Yesu nguwa lamabu'uum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál Deelór Aakoowo Qeeru aníng ina i hardáh, afór ur ngiri axaás ar axwees aluueé' wa ale. Afoorí a adór afór tarumbeéta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afoorí ina beér, «Gár kuúng ta aan gooiimeek baraá kitaábií alé, nee daqaní kay ya/áp amór múk kríshaanoó baraá gixsadaá faanqw, awa Efeso, nee Smirna, nee Pergamo, nee Tiatira, nee Sarde, nee Filadelfia, nee Laodikea.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng niri warqáw as heedá' amor'eé' axweés nguwa ar. Nee qoomár niwa warqáw, kiteeraá faanqw awa tsaa'asór koomá' awa taa tleéhh ar sahaábu ina ár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee baraá tla/ángw kiteeridá' tsaa'asór kooma'a, heeko una ár oo adór slaqsoó garmoó hee. Hiyoó naa dahaás aa hardáh ay baraá ya'a', nee himuú sahaábu gwaa gawaá da/eewawósií tseék. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se'éngw sagós ku ló'wa /awák adór se'éngw bee/aangw, nee adór tlaa/aá tluwaay. Nee ilaawós i gwa/aatiyá' adór tsángw asltá wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee ya'aawós a adór muqslír sirdaa/aat, ar taa hamaatla hhe'eés ar baraá asla. Nee afoorós a adór ma'aá yaariir awa wa/amiimá' baraá wa/ángw i alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee baraá dakós oo doó /iyayhe i tsatse/uú faánqw kón, nee paángár afa xaraasl badu tsaraawo i baraá afkós wa ti'iimít. Slám gitsee/aawós i gwa/aatiyá' adór tsee/amuú qoomár siiree/i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng qoomár nguwa ár, niri huú' dír ya'aawós i alé adór heé aa gwaa'. Dakós oo doó /iyáy nguri qaás gawaaeé' alé, iri oó', «Ma da'ayuumitaar. Aníng a kuduú geera nee kuduú alhhe'eesaay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kudá' slaáf. Aníng geeraawo ana gwaá', nee qaytsiít, hamí a slaáf ay alhhe'eesay wasle. Nee slám aníng gweermo a koóm ar gwa'ara nee ar baraá gi'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, muruudá' kuúng taa aán gooiimeek, kudá' dáw nee tam kudá' sangw hardáh sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu/aaroó tsatse/uudá' faanqw, kudá' kuúng taa aán baraá dakw'eé' oo doó /iyáy, nee oo kiteeridá' faanqw awa sahaábu awa tsaa'asór koomá', gídaabárós a tí: Tsatse/uudá' faanqw a malaykér múk kríshaanáyduú baraá gixsadaá faanqw. Nee kiteeridá' faanqw awa tsaa'asór koomá' a múk kríshaanáyduú baraá gixsadaá faanqw.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
